From b41ff8b529278216cba22a5dcdc93fea2a3a9619 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Maíra Canal <mcanal@igalia.com>
Date: Wed, 30 Sep 2026 16:06:50 -0300
Subject: drm/vc4: Free the BO cache size list on teardown
Mime-version: 1.0
Content-type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-transfer-encoding: 8bit
Git-commit: b41ff8b529278216cba22a5dcdc93fea2a3a9619
Patch-mainline: v7.3-rc7
References: git-fixes CVE-2026-98970 bsc#1288246

vc4_bo_cache_destroy() purges the cached BOs but never frees the size
list, leaking it on every unbind.

Fixes: c826a6e10644 ("drm/vc4: Add a BO cache.")
Assisted-by: LLM
Reviewed-by: Thadeu Lima de Souza Cascardo <cascardo@igalia.com>
Link: https://patch.msgid.link/20260930190721.1897264-1-mcanal@igalia.com
Signed-off-by: Maíra Canal <mcanal@igalia.com>
Acked-by: Takashi Iwai <tiwai@suse.de>

---
 drivers/gpu/drm/vc4/vc4_bo.c | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/drivers/gpu/drm/vc4/vc4_bo.c b/drivers/gpu/drm/vc4/vc4_bo.c
index 49ea2ed0996b..ea1be891ac78 100644
--- a/drivers/gpu/drm/vc4/vc4_bo.c
+++ b/drivers/gpu/drm/vc4/vc4_bo.c
@@ -1052,6 +1052,7 @@ static void vc4_bo_cache_destroy(struct drm_device *dev, void *unused)
 	cancel_work_sync(&vc4->bo_cache.time_work);
 
 	vc4_bo_cache_purge(dev);
+	kfree(vc4->bo_cache.size_list);
 
 	for (i = 0; i < vc4->num_labels; i++) {
 		if (vc4->bo_labels[i].num_allocated) {
-- 
2.55.0

